<!--
corona-gerboa-actor: the Council's Interpreter (avatar of the Corona).
A member of the Council as a giant jerboa, a company actor (scale 20 vpt, base anatomy with ears forward).
Ash-lilac coat with a light belly. It wears a big wide-brimmed musketeer hat in aqua green (#5ce0c8, the heraldic colour
of the Actor) with a gold band and buckle and a long white feather that rises behind the ears and falls back (the tip shines: glow="True");
on the muzzle a theatre half mask, half dark and half light like its seal; at the neck a pleated white ruff;
a dark green jerkin with gold buttons; an aqua green tail plume.
Box: 1.6 × 2.2 × 2.1 tiles, 32 × 44 × 42 voxels, 20 voxels per tile (vpt: 20).
Role: npc.
-->
